{"text":"永平四年歲次辛卯，九月一日甲午朔，比丘釋法興敬造彌勒像一軀，上爲皇家、師僧、父母、有識含生，普乘微善，龍華三會，俱望齊上。又願皇祚永隆，三寶暈延，法輪長唱。所生父母託生紫神，蓮昇兜率，面奉慈氏，足步虛空，悟發大解。所願如是。","tags":[{"name":"PersonName","term":"法興","refId":null,"text":"法興","start":20,"end":22},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":24,"end":26},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"有識","start":41,"end":43},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"含生","start":43,"end":45},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華","refId":null,"text":"龍華","start":51,"end":53},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"龍華三會","refId":null,"text":"三會","start":53,"end":55},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"三寶","refId":null,"text":"三寶","start":68,"end":70},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法輪","refId":null,"text":"法輪","start":73,"end":75},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"託生","refId":null,"text":"託生","start":82,"end":84},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"紫微","refId":null,"text":"紫神","start":84,"end":86},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"兜率","refId":null,"text":"兜率","start":89,"end":91},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"慈氏","start":94,"end":96}]}